List for the authors of these files would be quite a lot to generate correctly, so there I am only giving the directions on how to find them.
Each image is well downscaled and grayscale version of Ubuntu wallpapers, the selection is hand made by me.
The author for each file is mentioned in copyright file in the ubuntu-wallpaper packages that can be found here:

https://packages.ubuntu.com/questing/ubuntu-wallpapers

The last version I combed is 25.10 Questing. 

If you would like to get the author for a specific image, contact me and I will go through the packages to find it for you.
